    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense but it feels a bit vague. if you had to pick which one is the \"primary\" driver, which would it be? like, even if policy changes things, isn't the tech itself essentially going to keep advancing regardless of what any government does? it feels like the tech trajectory is the real constant here.",
