      "content": "In that case, the primary driver of the shift toward an automated economy is the inherent advancement of technological capabilities, particularly in the areas of artificial intelligence and robotics. This trajectory is largely driven by the laws of physics, computer science, and mathematical complexity, which inevitably push technological boundaries forward. While policy choices and corporate decisions can influence the pace and direction of technological development, they cannot fundamentally alter its underlying trajectory.",
